Modifications in this fork
==========================

This repository began as a fork of Screen Translator and has since been
reworked into a card-game decision assistant. The translation pipeline,
on-device OCR, text-to-speech and bundled local model runtimes have been
removed. What remains is the screen-capture and overlay infrastructure,
reused as a pluggable game-module framework, a Paohuzi (字牌) rules engine,
whole-screen recognition through a cloud vision model, and a decision engine
built on an OpenAI-compatible configuration. Architecture notes live in
docs/game-assistant/. Files added by this fork remain under the Apache
License, Version 2.0.

